<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Shorewood Packaging.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Shorewood Packaging.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of Shorewood Packaging Corp with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Set a $23 12-to-18-month price target on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/4 at 17-3/4.</p>
</text>
